    "updated_at": "2016-01-29T23:35:41Z",
    "body": "I'm not planning on doing SSL on my domains because it's too much hassle. (You have to pay more money, and then every few years do an annoying configuration change, etc. Plus if I stop being able to maintain my site, it'd mean the site goes down way earlier than otherwise. With HTTP, it just survives forever, at least while it's being funded, which can be a long time if it's prepaid.)\n",
